32 ! number of openmp threads per mpi rank
3 ! scheme (0 = MC-PIC, 1 = EC-PIC, 2 = I-NGP, 3 = I-CIC)
2.0 1.0 ! time step, fraction of initial plasma frequency, then absolute (s)
5.317772131794625e-06 ! total simulation time in seconds
5.317772131794625e-08 1e-6 1e-6 ! averaging time, relative residual acceptance for phi and density
21 ! number of diagnostic times
IASW_Chacon2013_ICIC ! save file name
../outputs/ ! directory to save to, relative to the build directory
no ! Restart(yes/no)
END
